VibeROM License and Original Copyright Notices
===============================================

VibeROM is a C#/.NET port of ROM 2.4b6. It is a derivative work of ROM,
Merc DikuMud and the original DikuMud, and is distributed under the terms
of all three licenses reproduced below. Nothing in this project grants
rights beyond those licenses.

The original authors retain copyright. Their names must remain in the login
sequence and in the `credits` command, and the ROM help entry must remain
available and unaltered as required by the ROM license.

